    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa Ng'holo na shitabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūbona shitabo ū mu nkono gwakwe ū gwa būlyo, ūyo walī igashije a hī Isumbi lya būtemi. Shalī shandīkilwe ū mu gatī na a higūlya, hama shūtungwa matungījo mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla nabona malaika wa nguzu alīhamuka n'ilaka itaale alīhaya gīkī, “Nani ūyo igeleelilwe kūgataligūla a matungījo gasho ī shitabo, na kūshikundūla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atigelile nūūlū ūmò, pye hose na hose ū ng'wigūlū nū mu sī, nūūlū ni mu gatī ya sī; atilongile wa kūdūla kūshikundūla ī shitabo shenīsho, nūūlū kūshilola dūhū yaya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalīla no nguno akagaya nūūlū ūmò, ūyo igeleelilwe kūshikundūla ī shitabo shenīsho, nūūlū kūshilola! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūmò wa Banamhala ūniwīla gīkī, ūtalīlage; nolage ūyo alī Shimba ya lūganda lo ng'wa Yuda, ūyo alī Nji go ng'wa Daūdi. Ū ng'wenūyo hū mpyeni, hū ng'wene akūgataligūla a matungījo mpungatī ga shitabo shenīsho, ashikundūle! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a ha gatī gatī yī Isumbī lya būtemi nūmona Ng'wana wa Ng'holo wīmīīlaga, walī apīndiwe nī Shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shine, hamò na a Banamhala. Walī gītī gīkī walī wasīnzwa, na walī na mapembe mpungatī na miso mpungatī. Ī yenīyo h'ī Myoyo ya ng'wa Mulungu īyo īkatūmagwa kūja hose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshika ūshisola ī shitabo ū mu nkono gwa būlyo gwakwe ūyo walī wigasha hī Isumbi lya būtemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washisola ī shitabo, ī Shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shine na a Banamhala abo makūmi abīlī na bane būgwa ū kū būtongi bokwe ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo. Būlī ng'wene walī na ndono; na baalī na nzweso ja zahabu jokalile ngazu go ng'waso gwawiza, hū būlombi wa beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kūhelelekeja kwīmba lyīmbo ipya; balīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūbona, hama niigwa n'ilaka itaale lya bamalaika baalī balīpīndije ī Lisumbī lya būtemi, nī Shiseeng'wa shipanga na a Banamhala. Ī lisaabu lyabo baalī būhī na būhī, makūmi ga mashihūmbī, ng'hangala mashihūmbī makūmi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahamukaga n'ilaka itaale balīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
